{
  "name": "PR-1 舊版 SKIP（沒綁 hash）不再放行 → BLOCK 並給升級指引",
  "why": "2026-07-29（0c）。舊格式 `<!-- ADVERSARIAL_REVIEW_SKIP: 理由 -->` 不綁 hash，一次寫下就**永久**關閉該檔的 PR-1——之後把整份計畫書改掉也不會再被檢查。改版後必須認得出舊格式並明確拒絕，而不是靜默放行（靜默放行＝升級當天所有既有 SKIP 全部繼續失效，而且沒人會知道）。訊息要給出可直接照抄的新格式與重算方式。",
  "workspace": {
    "files": {
      "LEGACY_PLAN.md": "# 測試計畫書\n\n> 狀態：待審核\n\n## §1 現況\n\n這裡是內容。\n\n<!-- ADVERSARIAL_REVIEW_SKIP: 舊格式，沒有綁 hash -->\n"
    },
    "transcript": [
      {
        "type": "user",
        "message": {
          "content": "更新這份計畫書"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "assistant",
        "message": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "tool_use",
              "name": "Edit",
              "input": {
                "file_path": "<DIR>/LEGACY_PLAN.md",
                "old_string": "...",
                "new_string": "..."
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "user",
        "message": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "tool_result",
              "content": "File updated"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "payload": {
    "hook_event_name": "Stop",
    "session_id": "fx-pr1",
    "transcript_path": "<TRANSCRIPT>",
    "cwd": "<DIR>",
    "stop_hook_active": false
  },
  "expect": {
    "decision": "BLOCK",
    "message_contains": "舊版"
  },
  "rule": "pr1_plan_review_marker"
}
